To generate compatible .NET-types and make the sample app work, they need to be
able to find a matching version of the CEF. Download a binary distribution from
https://cef-builds.spotifycdn.com/index.html and extract it to windows/ or linux/
in this directory. Copy or link the contents of Resources/ into the Release directory.

The resulting directory structure of cef/<os>/ looks like this:
include/
Release/
Resources/
LICENSE.txt
README.txt
etc...
